## Dependencies
- Python: aiohttp, websockets, llama-cpp-python (via PyO3 bridge)
- Rust: hace-sdk-me-core, pyo3 0.22 (bridge only — no CAPOR ownership)

## Invariant (CGE P1-B)
- MactorBackend trait does NOT return to FIM.
- executor-py = NEP-PY substrate implementation, not inference layer owner.
- FDI/FPI/FFI adapters are transport bridges, not routing authority.

## Status
**P1-B SEMANTIC LOCKED**: No aggressive refactor. Boundary documented. Legacy CAPOR/RACOR/IPO wrappers marked as delegates.
